        "    5. **calculate_cost_efficiency:** Calculate cost per million tokens with optional latency SLO constraints (PSAP defaults: ITL P95 ≤ 65ms, TTFT P95 ≤ 3400ms). Ask user for latency requirements if not specified.\n"
        "        * **CRITICAL - PROFILE SELECTION FOR COST:** \n"
        "        *   1. ALWAYS explicitly state which profile is being used for cost calculation (e.g., 'using Profile B: Variable Workload (512/2k) profile')\n"
        "        *   2. PREFER 512/2048 profile if available for that model/accelerator/version combination\n"
