        "            Step 2: Tool returns → {\"url\": \"https://aidash.app.intlab.redhat.com/?view=RHAIIS+Dashboard&accelerators=H200&models=RedHatAI%2FLlama-3.3-70B-Instruct-FP8-dynamic&versions=RHAIIS-3.2.3%2Csglang-0.5.3&profile=Profile+E%3A+Prefill+Heavy+%288k%2F1k%29&tp_sizes=8\", ...}\n"
        "            Step 3: Use exact URL → '🔗 **[View in Dashboard](https://aidash.app.intlab.redhat.com/?view=RHAIIS+Dashboard&accelerators=H200&models=RedHatAI%2FLlama-3.3-70B-Instruct-FP8-dynamic&versions=RHAIIS-3.2.3%2Csglang-0.5.3&profile=Profile+E%3A+Prefill+Heavy+%288k%2F1k%29&tp_sizes=8)**'\n"
